                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-panel p-3 rounded-2xl text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-cyan-400 mr-1"></i> <strong class="text-slate-200">Note:</strong> Visualization uses stylized spacing and scale for clarity and exploration purposes.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="planet-info-panel" class="absolute top-24 right-6 z-20 pointer-events-auto w-80 md:w-96 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform translate-x-[120%] opacity-0">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-cyan-500/30">
            <div>
                <span id="planet-subtitle" class="text-xs font-orbitron text-cyan-400 tracking-widest uppercase">Terrestrial Planet</span>
                <h2 id="planet-title" class="font-orbitron text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-wide">Earth</h2>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-close-info" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-500/20 text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-300 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
            </button>
        </div>

        <p id="planet-desc" class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our home planet is the third planet from the Sun, and the only place we know of so far that's inhabited by living things.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5 text-xs">
            <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">DIAMETER</span>
                <strong id="planet-diameter" class="text-cyan-300 font-orbitron">12,742 km</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">DISTANCE FROM SUN</span>
                <strong id="planet-distance" class="text-cyan-300 font-orbitron">149.6M km</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">DAY LENGTH</span>
                <strong id="planet-day" class="text-cyan-300 font-orbitron">24 hours</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">YEAR LENGTH</span>
                <strong id="planet-year" class="text-cyan-300 font-orbitron">365.25 days</strong>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 bg-cyan-950/30 p-3 rounded-xl border border-cyan-800/40 text-xs">
            <strong class="text-cyan-300 block mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-yellow-400 mr-1"></i> Fascinating Fact:</strong>
